Z||000000||mshill||02-29-2000||05:01 PM||||Here's one for the parts/cost category.<P>From my local Pontiac/Cadillac/GMC dealer parts counter:<P>Part Number	$ea.	QtyReq	Description<BR>11515757	1.30	  9	Exhaust Manifold Bolt<BR>25509575	2.20	  3	Exhaust Manifold Bolt w/Stud End<BR>14066450	2.80	  4	Exhaust Manifold to Y-pipe bolt<P><BR>The studs serve as the lower bolts for the fron manifold also require 2 bolts each, 1 for the manifold and one for the heat shield that goes on over the top of the manifold.<P>[This message has been edited by mshill (edited 02-29-2000).]<p>[This message has been edited by mshill (edited 03-01-2000).]||||reg||4
